{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺潭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云：又人聞一切法趣，即非漏非無漏，具一切法也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元小名同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即逢值第二類人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即逢值第三類人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云：十數皆依法界，法界外更無復法止，乃至佛法界亦復如\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云：又人聞一切法趣，即非漏非無漏，具一切法也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "籤云：所以判者，今法華經約此四諦為何教四諦所攝止，方顯\n今經部圓教圓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "籤云：總而言之，祇是四句破假，性相二空，故得幻化即空之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "籤云：行者常觀一念介爾起心，以具一切心故，等於\n佛心。又云：祇於貪瞋一念心起，體即權實。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云：祇隱其無量功德莊嚴之身，現為丈六。紫金輝記云：祇是\n隱實施權，且云當分。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云神力品中約教次第，止序品約行次第等，記釋云云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云不如三界止，今取佛所見為實\n相正體也。記釋云云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云：若廢權顯實，如前所用記。釋云：如前標體中等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄云：色無邊故，般若亦無邊。記云：五陰是理故，即陰是實相般\n若，故皆無邊。以由理故，令法無邊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄第一德云自解佛乘，至第九德云玄悟法華圓意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相待"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "絕待"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄問：既以五味分別，那同稱漸？記釋云：問前五味教\n相，味既有五，何故中問三味皆名為漸？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擊拂子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具之一字，即三\n千也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "體也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提起諸法實相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "點此三千玅境是中道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文見釋籤第二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信知三千諸法\n不易得聞，其猶世尊四十餘年久默斯要"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指要云：一念三千為開顯大綱。又云：即中\n是法身究竟義故。豈非的指中道耶？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一句驗大師心中所行，行於中道，即同十方三世諸佛，常居中道，常行中道。若不然者，何名初心即用佛智照\n境耶？何名上品寂光為觀體耶？初緣實相，造境即中，蓋見於此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293001", "type": "orig", "text": "實疑寶"}
{"id": null, "n": "0298001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0298001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0282b1801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0282b1801", "type": "add", "text": "台宗教觀撮要論卷第三【CB】，［－］【卍續】"}
